<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Admin Dashboard · ADF 2027</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --cream: #f8f7df; --orange: #f9dca6; --red: #c9272d; --red-button: #ce2b2f;
      --navy: #162b45; --white: #ffffff; --dark-text: #333333; --muted: #8c8c8c; --gray: #eeeeee;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; background: var(--cream); font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--dark-text); }
    header {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 18px 28px; background: var(--navy); color: var(--white);
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; }
    header .who { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #cfd8e3; }
    header form { margin: 0; }
    header button, header .site-link {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); background: transparent; color: var(--white);
      padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.75rem; cursor: pointer; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    header .site-link { text-decoration: none; }
    header button:hover, header .site-link:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }

    main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 26px 20px 60px; }

    .stat-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .stat-card {
      flex: 1; min-width: 150px; background: var(--white); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(22,43,69,0.08);
    }
    .stat-card .num { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--red); }
    .stat-card .label { font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

    .tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .tab-btn {
      border: none; background: var(--gray); color: var(--navy); padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .tab-btn.active { background: var(--red-button); color: var(--white); }

    .panel { display: none; background: var(--white); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(22,43,69,0.08); }
    .panel.active { display: block; }

    .panel-toolbar { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .panel-toolbar input[type="search"] {
      flex: 1; min-width: 200px; height: 38px; border: 1px solid rgba(22,43,69,0.25); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0 12px; font: inherit;
    }
    .link-btn { color: var(--red); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }

    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    th, td { text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray); vertical-align: top; }
    th { font-size: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    tr:hover td { background: #fbfaf0; }

    .pill {
      display: inline-block; padding: 2px 9px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .pill.unread { background: #fff1c9; color: #8a6100; }
    .pill.read { background: var(--gray); color: var(--muted); }

    .action-btn {
      border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin-right: 10px;
    }
    .action-btn.danger { color: var(--red); }
    .action-btn.neutral { color: var(--navy); }

    .empty-state { padding: 30px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }

    .msg-body { max-width: 340px; white-space: pre-wrap; }

    .retention-card {
      background: var(--white); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(22,43,69,0.08); margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .retention-card h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--navy); }
    .retention-card p { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 620px; }
    .retention-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
    .retention-row input[type="date"] {
      height: 38px; border: 1px solid rgba(22,43,69,0.25); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0 10px; font: inherit;
    }
    .retention-row button {
      height: 38px; padding: 0 16px; border: none; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--red-button);
      color: var(--white); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .retention-row button:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
    .retention-status { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.78rem; }
    .retention-status.success { color: #1f7a3f; }
    .retention-status.error { color: var(--red); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>ADF 2027 · Admin Dashboard</h1>
    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px;">
      <span class="who">Signed in as <%= adminUsername %></span>
      <a class="site-link" href="/">Main site</a>
      <form method="post" action="/admin/logout"><button type="submit">Log out</button></form>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num"><%= registrationCount %></div><div class="label">Registrations</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num"><%= messageCount %></div><div class="label">Messages</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num"><%= unreadCount %></div><div class="label">Unread messages</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="retention-card">
      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        Permanently deletes registrations (and their screenshot files) created before the date you
        choose below. This cannot be undone — export a CSV backup first if you want a record.
        The same action is available from the command line via <code>npm run purge-old-data</code>,
        e.g. for a scheduled cron job once you've settled on a fixed retention period.
      </p>
      <div class="retention-row">
        <label for="purgeBefore" style="font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--navy);">Delete registrations before:</label>
        <input type="date" id="purgeBefore">
        <button type="button" id="purgeBtn">Delete</button>
      </div>
      <div class="retention-status" id="purgeStatus"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="tabs">
      <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="registrations">Registrations</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="messages">Contact messages</button>
    </div>

    <section class="panel active" id="panel-registrations">
      <div class="panel-toolbar">
        <input type="search" id="regSearch" placeholder="Search by name, email, or student number…">
        <a class="link-btn" href="/admin/export/registrations.csv">Export CSV</a>
      </div>
      <div id="regTableWrap"><div class="empty-state">Loading…</div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" id="panel-messages">
      <div class="panel-toolbar">
        <span></span>
      </div>
      <div id="msgTableWrap"><div class="empty-state">Loading…</div></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="/admin/dashboard.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
